// Instant self-centered burst, level-1 tier (scaled down from
// hemomancy/gory_eruption.ron's level-3 numbers). The sheet's "cannot take
// reactions" rider has no analog in this real-time combat system (no
// reaction/action-economy resource exists to deny) and is dropped. Necrotic
// flavor: `Explosion`'s damage is hardcoded to `DamageKind::Crushing`
// (common/src/states/explosion.rs), not RON-configurable -- same
// pre-existing gap as sword_burst.ron/gory_eruption.ron.
Explosion(
    energy_cost: 30,
    buildup_duration: 0.5,
    action_duration: 0.25,
    recover_duration: 0.35,
    damage: 18,
    poise: 10,
    knockback: (direction: Away, strength: 8.0),
    radius: 3,
    min_falloff: 0.3,
    dodgeable: Roll,
    destroy_terrain: None,
    eye_height: false,
    reagent: None,
    meta: (school: Some(Conjuration), source: Some(Arcane)),
)
